# Kordis Stage Login

## Stage environment

- **Login URL**: https://stage.app.kordis.io/login
- **Base URL**: https://stage.app.kordis.io

Use these for e2e login tests and config so specs run against stage.

## Where to set them

- **cypress.config.js**: Keep `e2e.baseUrl` as `https://stage.app.kordis.io`.
- **cypress/fixtures/example.json**: Use `url.Live` (or equivalent) for the stage base or login URL, e.g. `https://stage.app.kordis.io/` or `https://stage.app.kordis.io/login`.
- **Login-page.js**: `OpenURL` should receive the URL from fixtures or config; do not hardcode a different base in page objects.

## Login flow (stage)

- Email: `input#email`
- Password: `#password`
- Submit: `.authButton` or `.login-submit-btn` (use `.first()` if both exist)
- Logout: `#logout-form > .sc-iTOPbJ` (prefer a stable `data-*` selector when available)

When adding or changing login specs, keep credentials in fixtures (e.g. `example.json`) and do not commit real production credentials.
